; Normal systemd 259.9 owns selected Linux login slices independently of
; Android. native-user-cgroups.json binds the actual original/fixture GDM
; identities and UID 1000 to the same stock user@.service delegation contract.
; The global root has only a named user.slice transition. Unknown UID slices
; get a non-creatable type; the three manager roots retain separate UID types.
